---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Pro Bono Health Advice — Miranda Essig" description="Call the show. Encouragement to get long and strong — not medical advice.">
  <section style="background-color:#bd5a80" class="text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16">
      <p class="uppercase tracking-widest text-white/80 text-sm">Pro Bono Health Advice</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold max-w-3xl">Call the show.</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-white/90 max-w-2xl">Free encouragement for anyone trying to get healthier and live long and strong. Repetitive, no-excuses, and in your corner.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14">
    <div class="rounded-2xl p-6" style="background-color:#faf1e8;border:1px solid #f0dcc5">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-[#7a4a1e]">A quick, honest note</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[#7a5327] leading-relaxed">I'm not a doctor or a licensed health professional. I share what I've learned and lived — take it as encouragement, not medical advice, and please talk to a professional about your specific situation.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12">What we talk about</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed">Small, repeatable steps toward a healthier body and mind — food, movement, and the mindset to keep going. Same spirit as the Longevity Pillars: choose your hard, and take it one step at a time.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12">Would a community help?</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed">I'm thinking about building a community for people doing this together — accountability, encouragement, and shared wins. If that sounds like something you'd want to be part of, tell me.</p>
    <a href="mailto:mirandaessig@gmail.com?subject=I%27d%20want%20a%20Long%20Strongs%20community" class="inline-block mt-6 rounded-full text-white font-medium px-7 py-3 transition" style="background-color:#bd5a80">I'd want in</a>
  </section>
</Base>
